<title>USA: CoreStates' 4 top officers raise company ownership.</title>
<headline>CoreStates' 4 top officers raise company ownership.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoreStates Financial Corp said Monday that its four most senior officers have increased their direct ownership of the company.</p>
